---
interface Props {
  title?: string;
}
const { title = '重要提醒' } = Astro.props as Props;
---
<div class="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-5" role="alert">
  <h2 class="font-bold text-red-800 mb-2">{title}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-red-700 leading-relaxed">
    安装系统前，请务必备份重要数据。分区、格式化或安装操作可能导致数据丢失。
  </p>
</div>